==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
Old Norse [[þvá]], compare Old Norse svá > Icelandic svo.

===Verb===
'''þvo'''

# to [[wash]], to [[do]] (laundry)
#: ''Að '''þvo''' [[þvottur|þvott]].''
#:: '''Doing''' [[laundry]].

====Usage notes====
* '''Þvo''' is the only verb in Icelandic which ends in an '''-o'''.

